No, seriously, tourists 

- rely on their pets 
- run away
- try to scare monsters

The main point is to get a good AC before the monsters 
become any stronger.  Hence, keep low level, scare monsters 
away rather than killing them, consider to do the 
protection dive, and never go far from your pet in the 
early game.  Once you are skilled or better with a 
weapon, you can start twoweaponing (look for wimpy 
opponents, since this takes a while to become useful).  
Best early weapons are daggers (Sting) and Crysknifes.  

